Resolution function:
```python
def resolve_token(tok, bindings):
    tok = tok.upper()
    if tok in KNOWN_CLASSES: return ("frozen_class", tok, None)
    if tok in ("AF-WCC","AF-SCC"): return ("family_abbreviation", None, None)
    # exact registered variant: parent-variantid
    for (parent, vid) in bindings:
        if tok == f"{parent}-{vid}": return ("registered_variant", parent, vid)
    # if a registered variant token is a prefix of tok? e.g. tok = AF-WCC-VAC-GEN-SET-something -> not our case
    # if tok is a proper prefix of a registered variant token -> truncation artifact
    longer = [f"{p}-{v}" for p,v in bindings if f"{p}-{v}".startswith(tok) and f"{p}-{v}" != tok]
    if longer: return ("truncated_prefix_of_registered_variant", None, longer)
    return ("unresolved", None, None)
```

